## 思路

**定长滑动窗口**:窗口大小为 `p.length`,用两个哈希表(或数组)维护窗口与 `p` 的字符频次。用一个计数 `valid` 记录窗口中频次已匹配的字符种类数,`valid === need.size` 时记录起点。

## 参考代码

```js
function findAnagrams(s, p) {
  const res = [];
  if (s.length < p.length) return res;
  const need = new Map();
  for (const c of p) need.set(c, (need.get(c) || 0) + 1);
  const window = new Map();
  let valid = 0;
  const needKeys = need.size;
  for (let i = 0; i < s.length; i++) {
    const c = s[i];
    if (need.has(c)) {
      window.set(c, (window.get(c) || 0) + 1);
      if (window.get(c) === need.get(c)) valid++;
    }
    if (i >= p.length) {
      const out = s[i - p.length];
      if (need.has(out)) {
        if (window.get(out) === need.get(out)) valid--;
        window.set(out, window.get(out) - 1);
      }
    }
    if (valid === needKeys) res.push(i - p.length + 1);
  }
  return res;
}
```

## 复杂度

- 时间:O(n)
- 空间:O(k),k 为字符集大小
